cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "phantomdep-pr-gate: audit the dependencies a pull request adds"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/phantomdep-pr-gate"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/phantomdep-pr-gate"
abstract: >-
  Audits only the dependencies a pull request adds: whether each new package
  exists on npm or PyPI at all (the slopsquatting signal), its age, and its
  weekly downloads. Verdicts follow an exact, documented exit policy.
keywords:
  - dependencies
  - pull request
  - supply chain
  - slopsquatting
  - audit
